    {
      "text": "Fig. 1, 'Product master data'. A health product, drawn as a boxed medicine package, is linked to PRODUCT MASTER DATA, shown as four categories with examples. General Information: product identifier, name, description, unit of measure. Classification: ICD, ATC, product characteristics/specifications. Pharmaceutical Information: dosage, strength, route of administration, doses per vial. Logistical Information: packaging, volumetrics, shelf life, storage temperature.",
